---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Header } from '@/components/Header';
import { Footer } from '@/components/Footer';
import { ArrowLeft, RefreshCw } from 'lucide-react';
import { BUSINESS_DETAILS } from '@/data/content';

const title = 'Refund & Cancellation Policy | RO Service Support Bangalore';
const description = 'Refund and cancellation policy for doorstep RO water purifier repair, AMC, and installation services provided by RO Service Support in Bangalore.';
const canonical = 'https://www.roservicesupport.co.in/refund-policy';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <Header currentRoute="/refund-policy" client:only="react" />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 py-12 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-700 bg-white border border-slate-200 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl mb-6 shadow-2xs transition-colors">
        <ArrowLeft className="w-4 h-4" />
        Back to Homepage
      </a>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-md">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-6 mb-8">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3 border border-blue-200">
            <RefreshCw className="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            <span>Legal Document</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Last Updated: January 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">

          <p class="text-slate-600">
            At <strong>RO Service Support</strong>, customer satisfaction is our top priority. This Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy outlines the terms under which cancellations and refunds are processed for our doorstep RO water purifier services in Bangalore.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">1. Cancellation Before Technician Dispatch</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>You may cancel your booking free of charge at any time <strong>before the technician is dispatched</strong>.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>Simply call <strong>{BUSINESS_DETAILS.formattedPhone}</strong> or reply to your confirmation SMS/WhatsApp with the cancellation request.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>No cancellation charges apply.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">2. Cancellation After Technician Dispatch</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>If you cancel after the technician has been dispatched but before service begins, a nominal visit charge of <strong>₹199</strong> may apply to cover travel and inspection costs.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>If the technician has already performed a diagnostic check, the ₹299 inspection fee is non-refundable.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">3. Cancellation After Service Begins</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>Once service work has commenced (e.g., filters replaced, parts installed, repairs performed), <strong>cancellation is not possible</strong> and full payment is due.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>However, if you are dissatisfied with the completed work, please contact us within 30 days — we will send a technician for a free re-inspection under our labor warranty.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">4. Refund Eligibility</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600">Refunds are processed under the following conditions:</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span><strong>Service not performed:</strong> If you paid in advance and the technician failed to arrive, a full refund will be issued within 5–7 business days.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span><strong>Duplicate payment:</strong> If you accidentally paid twice for the same service, the excess amount will be refunded immediately upon verification.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span><strong>Defective spare part:</strong> If a replaced part fails within its warranty period, we will first offer free replacement. If the replacement also fails, we may issue a partial refund for that specific part.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">5. Non-Refundable Items</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>Doorstep inspection fee (₹299) after diagnostics have been performed.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>Completed service charges (labor, filters, spare parts installed).</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>AMC plans once activated and used for any visit or filter replacement.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>Consumables such as sediment filters, carbon blocks, or membranes once installed.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">6. AMC (Annual Maintenance Contract) Refund</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>AMC cancellations within <strong>7 days of purchase</strong> and <strong>before any service visit</strong> are eligible for a full refund minus a 5% processing fee.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>After the first service visit under AMC, no refund is possible.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">7. Refund Processing Time</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>Approved refunds are processed within <strong>5 to 7 business days</strong>.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>For UPI/card payments, refunds are credited back to the original payment method.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>For cash payments, refunds are issued via bank transfer or UPI to your preferred account.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">8. How to Request a Refund</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600">To request a refund, please contact us with:</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>Your full name and mobile number</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>Date and location of service</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>Payment receipt or transaction ID</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 mt-2 shrink-0" /><span>Reason for the refund request</span></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-2 mt-3">
              <p class="text-slate-700"><strong>RO Service Support</strong></p>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs">Bangalore, Karnataka, India</p>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs">Phone: <a href="tel:{BUSINESS_DETAILS.phone}" class="text-sky-600 underline">{BUSINESS_DETAILS.formattedPhone}</a></p>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs">Email: <a href="mailto:{BUSINESS_DETAILS.email}" class="text-sky-600 underline">{BUSINESS_DETAILS.email}</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer currentRoute="/refund-policy" client:only="react" />
</Layout>